\newlabel{fig:scale}{{2}{8}{End-to-end PCG solve time on the multiphase Poisson benchmark, 20 frames per scale (mean $\pm 1\sigma $ band). Dashed grey lines mark the 24 and 60 fps interactive budgets}{figure.caption.2}{}}
